r.wal and does sys.path.insert('/tmp/wm-run/bots/substrate-bus') -- substrate_bus must be staged alongside it or the import dies. Staged script md5 206682962c06f9814a5db65c2fbc7267 -- byte-identical to upstream and to every prior run. No code changes were needed this run. A full 'git clone --depth 50' into /tmp was started first and abandoned (multi-GB pack, ~2.0 GB after 60 s, still transferring); the contents-API staging path remains the reliable route.", "canon_poll": "OK 200 -- no change vs 2026-10-22T20:04Z baseline (stable ~25.0h)", "baseline_hash": "b20375d389cb505d", "canon_count": 71, "canon_changed": false, "verified_by": "watcher poll_canon() + independent curl probe BEFORE AND AFTER the run (HTTP 200, 13720 bytes, bodies byte-identical, sha256(json, sort_keys)[:16] match)", "script_md5": "206682962c06f9814a5db65c2fbc7267", "upstream_clone_head": "79f835c0", "witness_rows": 57, "inherited_row_audit": "53/53 machine rows verify; 2 RECOVERED markers; 1 stale hash (row 25) re-verified upstream-born against git blob at HEAD 79f835c0 (witness.log byte-identical to the 353f663 baseline, md5 c278d9f66170decb8238e59baaba5909)", "orphan_rows": 13, "orphan_detail": "13 bot_started rows with no immediately-following witness_note (rows 1,3,5,7,10,13,15,17,18,19,23,28,35); row 44 and row 56 are NOT orphans -- 44 is followed by the row-45 witness_note, and 56 is closed by this note (row 57)", "event_census": "57 rows: 30 bot_started, 17 witness_note, 6 poll_failed, 2 meta_wipe_recovery, 2 first_poll", "workspace_status": "NAS mount 100% full, 0 bytes avail, git clone into it fails with 'Disk quota exceeded'; recovered via contents API + raw.githubusercontent staging to /tmp/wm-run (22nd wipe)", "open_defect": "bookkeeper budget=1000.0 vs gamma+eta=70.0; (0,0) escape clause AST-proven UNREACHABLE on all call paths, so last_conserved is False everywhere and carries no signal"}, "hash": "3414726f6fa331b6"}
